WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:04.209
AGENCY
Control your computer with your eyes. AGENCY does the rest.

2
00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.501
The cursor follows your eyes
Rest on anything and its ring fills: no hands, no clicks

3
00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.961
Order food: look at Food

4
00:00:08.961 --> 00:00:17.054
A few big choices at a time
Large targets, so a normal webcam is enough

5
00:00:17.054 --> 00:00:21.290
Synapse-Mesh routes it, Cisco checks the network, Gemini plans it
Everyday tasks take Synapse's fast lane

6
00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.701
It asks only what it needs to know

7
00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:29.169
Nothing pays or sends without your look
The exact amount, store and order, before anything happens

8
00:00:29.169 --> 00:00:32.772
Paying takes a second look at a different button
A glance never pays. Practice store: nothing real is paid

9
00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:36.275
Done, and checked
AGENCY reads the result back before it says done

10
00:00:36.275 --> 00:00:44.728
Talk: build a sentence with your eyes

11
00:00:44.729 --> 00:00:50.001
Gemini offers ways to finish it
One look speaks the whole sentence out loud

12
00:00:50.001 --> 00:00:52.203
Spoken out loud by the Mac

13
00:00:52.203 --> 00:00:56.344
Help is always one look away
In the app: three long blinks, or the Help button

14
00:00:56.344 --> 00:01:03.062
Your people are alerted unless you cancel
Cancel takes a longer look, so it never happens by accident

15
00:01:03.868 --> 00:01:08.368
AGENCY
Gemini plans · Synapse-Mesh routes · Cisco checks the network
